    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shilooti sha ng'wa Falao",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho yabīta myaka ībīlī migima, ū Falao ūloota shilooti wīmīīlaga bbihī na mongo gwa Nile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwimanīla jafumbūka ng'ombe mpugatī kūfuma ū mu mongo gwenūyo, jikūdīīmaga madete; jalī ng'īnu no hangī jawiza kīngī nasho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma na ng'ombe jingī mpungatī jūfumbūka kūfuma ū mu mongo gwa Nile gwenūyo; ī jene jalī dīīda jabūbi no, hama ngombooku kūheeba, jūshika jīmīīla a ha lūgegu lwa mongo bbihī nī jawiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ng'ombe ījo jalī dīīda na ngombooku, jūjilya ījo jalī ng'īnu na jawiza. Ū Falao ūbbamhuka ū mu tūlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yūmīta hangī ī tūlo, ūloota hangī lūkangala lwa kabīlī; ūbona mangala mpungatī ga būsīga gahoolile kūfuma h'itina līmò, gaalī mataale, nī mbeke jago jawiza no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ūbona na mangala gangī mpungatī ga būsīga, nago gahoolile kūfuma h'itina līmò; a gene gaalī manyalīīzu, na gakalamuchiwe lūyaga lo kīya! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A mangala mpungatī ayo gaalī manyalīīzu, gūgalya a mangala mpungatī a mataale, ayo gaalī na mbeke jawiza. Ū Falao ūbbamhuka hangī ū mu tūlo; ūbona gashi shilooti dūhū! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo aho weela ī dilū, akakoya no ū mu maganiko; hūna ūbalagīlīja bize pye a bachūūja",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41:8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Bachūūja:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Banhū abo bakagemaga kūlagū mu nguzu ja myoyo misoso, nūūlū kūbawīla bichabo mihayo īyo īlabilongele kū shikū ja kū būtongi.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " na a bachembi ba ngoko ba mu Misili. Ū Falao ūbasomboolela ī shilooti shakwe, alīyo atilongile nūūlū ūmò wabo, wa kūdūla kūnshomelegeja ī shilooti shenīsho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo ū ntaale wa bang'wisha ūng'wīla ū Falao gīkī, “Lelo nawizūkwa ū būhūbi bone. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makanza malebe ū Falalo walī wabapelanīla a batūmami bakwe; ūniponya mu jeela ū nene nū ntaale wa bazugi ba migatī, tūlugalīlwa mu numba ya ntaale wa balang'hani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lūshikū lūmò mu būjikū tūloota, būlī ng'wene shilooti shakwe na makūlū gasho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu jeela ng'wenūmo akasangwa alīmo na nsūmba Ng'hebulania, ntūmami wa ntaale wa balang'hani; gwike nang'hwe walī mfungwa ng'wichiswi. Ū nsūmba ng'wenūyo aho twanootoolela ī shilooti shise, ūtūshomelegeja a makūlū gasho; būlī ng'wene na makūlū ga shilooti shakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana pyī īkashikīīla ūmo akatūshomelegeja, gūtalebile ho nūūlū gūmò; ū nene nūshoshiwa a ha nīmo gwane, ū ng'wichane ūbūlagwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yosefu kūndegeleka Falao",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Falao ūlagīja ī likanza lyenīlo enhwe ū Yosefu; haho na haho ūfunyiwa ū mu jeela. Aho wamala kūmooga ndezu ūzwala na myenda yīngī, wiza ū kūlī Falao, ūshika wīmīīla kū būtongi bokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Falao ūng'wīla gīkī, “Naalootaga shilooti, gwike atīho nūūlū ūmò wa kūnishomelegeja. Alīyo nigwaga gīkī, ū bebe ūlū ūshiigwa ī shilooti, ūkashideebaga washishomeleja.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yosefu ūnshokeja ū Falao ūhaya, “Ū nene natūgūdūla ū mhayo gwenūyo, alīyo ū Mulungu hū ng'wene akūng'winha ū Falao ishosho lyawiza.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Falao wandya kūnootoolela ū Yosefu; ūng'wīla, “Ū mu shilooti shane, naalī nīmīīlaga bbihī na ngegu ja mongo gwa Nile, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwimanīla ū kūfuma ū mu mongo ng'wenūmo, jafumbūka ng'ombe mpugatī ng'īnu jawiza, jikūdīīmaga madete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma jūfumbūka na ng'ombe jingī mpungatī kūfuma ū mu mongo gwa Nile gwenūyo; ī jene jalī dīīda jabūbi no, hangī ngombooku kūheeba. Nataalī kūbona na kamò ng'ombe jabūbi gīko pye a hose ū mu sī ya Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ng'ombe ījo jalī dīīda na ngombooku, jūjilya ī mpungatī ī ja kwandya, ījo jalī ng'īnu na jawiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo nūūlū aho jajilya, jikikala ngombooku dūhū, walī atīho wa kūdeeba gīkī jajilyaga; nguno jalī jitaalī jabūbi dūhū, gīt'umo jalī ī kwandya. Hūna nūbbamhuka ū mu tūlo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
