            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū mu shilooti shane, naalī nabona na mangala mpungatī ga būsīga gahoolile kūfuma h'itina līmò, mataale ga mbeke jawiza no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma nūbona na mangala gangī mpungatī ga būsīga, nago gahoolile kūfuma h'itina līmò; a gene manyalīīzu, gakalamuchiwe lūyaga lo kīya! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A mangala mpungatī ayo gaalī manyalīīzu, gūgalya a mangala mpungatī a mataale, ayo gaalī na mbeke jawiza. Na lūūlū naalī nabawīla a bachūūja, alīyo atigelile nūūlū ūmò wa kūniwīla a makūlū gaho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yosefu koolecha makūlū ga shilooti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yosefu ūng'wīla ū Falao gīkī, “Ī shilooti sha ng'wa Falao shilī sha mbika īmò nguno shilī shimò dūhū. Ū Mulungu wang'olekejaga ū Falao mhayo ūyo alīhaya kūgwīta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ng'ombe jawiza ījo mpungatī jilī myaka mpungatī; na a mangala ga būsīga ayo mpungatī a gawiza nayo mpyaka mpungatī. Ī shoi shilī shilooti shimò dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ng'ombe mpungatī ī jabūbi ījo jalī jafumbūka ha numa, īlī myaka mpungatī; pye na a mangala a manyalīīzu ayo gakalamuchiwe lūyaga lwa kīya, ī yenīyo myaka mpungatī ya nzala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ūmo nalīng'wīlīla ū Falao, gīkī ū Mulungu wang'olekejaga ū Falao mhayo ūyo alīhaya kūgwīta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īliza myaka mpungatī ya mbooto nūlūmhona",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41:29",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mbooto:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū ndooshi; ikanza lya shilīwa shingī.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nhaale hose pyī ū mu sī ya Misili; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alīyo a ha numa yaho īkwiza myaka yīngī mpungatī ya nzala. A henaho pyī ī mbooto nūlū mhona ya mu Misili īkwīwa; hama ī nzala īkwīkenaagūla no ī sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndūhū wa kūyizūkwa nūūlū ūmò ī mhona ya mu sī; nguno ī nzala īyo īkūkūūbīja īkūbiza nhaale no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shilooti shenīshi wenhelagwa ū Falao mu mbika ibīlī kūlwa nguno ū mhayo gwenūyū gwafunyiwe na Mulungu; hama nīyo ū Mulungu akūgūshikīlīja wangū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ī haha ni yabeelela ū Falao asole munhū wa masala na ng'witegeleja, antūūle kūbiza ntaale ū mu Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ū Falao atūūle na bambīlīja hose pyī ū mu sī yenīyī; balayūsola īmò y'itanò ya shilīwa shose īsho shikwigela ū mu sī ya Misili, ū mu myaka īyo mpungatī ī ya mbooto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū benabo babize na nīmo gwa kūshisoleleja pyī ī shilīwa ū mu myaka yawiza īyo īliza. Nīyo ū Falao afunye shilagīlo gīkī, ī shilīwa shenīsho shibīkwe chiza ū mu magūngūli kūlwa shikū ja kū būtongi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shilang'hanwe kūlwa kūtūmamīla ū mu shikū ja nzala ya myaka mpungatī īyo īliza ū mu sī ya Misili; ī sī ītizūkenaagūlwa nzala.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yosefu ntaale wa Misili",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo gwenūyo gūbeela ū kūlī Falao, nū kū bana ng'oma bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Falao ūbabūja gīkī, “Tūdūgije kūpandīka munhū ūngī ose ose wa kūbiza gītī ng'wenūyū; ūyo alī na moyo gwa ng'wa Mulungu mulī we?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Falao ūng'wīla ū Yosefu gīkī, “Nīyo īkī ū Mulungu wakoolekejaga ī mihayo yenīyī, atīho ūngī wa kūbiza gītī bebe ū mu būdeeba, nū witegeleja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū bebe wabizaga ntaale wa kaya yane; pye a banhū bane bakūbiza ha sīlīlī ya shilagīlo shako. Ū nene nakūbiza ntaale ū kūlī bebe kūlwa nguno y'isumbī dūhū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Falao ūnkomeleja ū Yosefu alīg'wīla, “Managa gīkī naakūtūūlaga ha būtaale bo sī yose ya Misili.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo ū Falao wīzuula ī sīīlī yakwe ya kūmeng'hela, īyo yalī kū lwaala lwakwe; ūnzwalīkīja Yosefu kū lwaala lwakwe. Ūnzwīka na myenda y'ikūjo ya kitaani, na ngufu gwa zahabu ū mu nhingo yakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama ūlagīja ū Yosefu wigashe ng'wigogoteeni lyakwe, koolecha gīkī ū mu sī ya Misili walī wa kabīlī ū mu būtaale. Hūna a banhū bandya kūhamuka na būyegi bakūhayaga, “Tujagi mazwi!” Ūbiza wantūūlwa ha būtaale wa sī yose ya Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Falao ūng'wīla ū Yosefu gīkī, “Ū nene nalī Falao, alīyo ū bebe ūlū ūtayombile mhayo, atīho munhū nūūlū ūmò wa kwīta mhayo gose gose ū mu sī ya Misili ī yose.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Falao ūng'wilīka ū Yosefu lina lya Zafenati-panea; ūng'winha na Asenati, nshīke wa ng'wa Potifela ngabīji wa Oni, kūbiza nke wakwe. Ū Yosefu wīyeleela pyī ī sī ya Misili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shilooti kūshikīīla",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yosefu walī na myaka makūmi adatū, aho alandya būtūmami ū mu būsugi bo ng'wa Falao, ū ntemi wa Misili. Ū Yosefu atigashije dūhū ng'wikūlū lya ng'wa Falao, akīnga wandya kūja hose hose ū mu sī ya Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu myaka mpungatī ī ya mbooto nūlū mhona, ī shilīwa shapyaga shingī no ū mu sī yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pyī ī shilīwa īsho shigelaga ū mu sī ya Misili, ū mu myaka mpungatī ī ya mbooto nūlū mhona, ū Yosefu washikumingaga washibīka mu magūngūli. Būlī igūngūli lyalī na ha kūsūmbīja ī shilīwa sha mu malaale galyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shilīwa īsho akashibīka ū Yosefu shikakwīla no, shūbiza gītī maseni ga ha nyanza; nose ooya ū kūshilola ū wingī washo, nguno shikakīlanīja a ha būbalīlwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho ītaalī kwandya ī myaka ya nzala, ū Asenati, ū nshīke wa ng'wa Potifela ngabīji wa Oni, akamyalīla ū Yosefu bitūnja babīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yosefu ūng'wilīka ū tangī wakwe Manase; nguno akahaya, “Ū Mulungu waninhile kūgīība pye a makoye gane, nī kaya ya ng'wa baba pyī ī yose.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'witūnja wa kabīlī ūng'wilīka Efulaimu; ūhaya, “Nguno ū Mulungu waninhile mbyala mu sī ya kūluhiwa kwane.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.52"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī myaka mpungatī ya mbooto nūlū mhona ū mu sī ya Misili yūkalīka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hūna yandya nī myaka mpungatī ī ya nzala, gīt'umo walī wahayīla dūhū ū Yosefu. Ī sī ī jingī pye jakoyaga no, nguno ī nzala yalī ng'halī; alīyo ū mu Misili shalīmo ī shilīwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī Misili nayo aho yandya kūkoya nzala, a banhū būyūnīlīīla ū Falao, balīkooba shilīwa. Alīyo ū Falao ūbawīla pye a Bamisili gīkī, “Jagi kūlī Yosefu mukīīte pyī īyo alīmuwīla kwīta.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī nzala aho yasanja hose pyī ū mu sī, ū Yosefu wandya kūjilugūla ī numba ja mabīkīlo ga shilīwa; ūyūbajingīja ī shilīwa a Bamisili, nguno ī nzala īkabiza ng'halī no pye a hose ū mu sī yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī nzala yalī nhaale no ū mu sī pyī ī jose, na lūūlū nī sī ī jingī pye jikayiza kūgūla shilīwa ū kūlī Yosefu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.57",
